{
  "id": "yadava",
  "title": "The Yadavas of Devagiri",
  "description": "An illustrated map of the Yadavas, or Seunas, who ruled the western Deccan from the rock fort of Devagiri, saw Marathi literature begin with Chakradhar and Dnyaneshwar, and were the first kingdom of the Deccan to fall to Delhi.",
