  "mapLabel": "The Yadavas of Devagiri, about 860 to 1318 CE",
  "note": "Based on Yadava inscriptions, the Marathi works of the Mahanubhavas and Dnyaneshwar, and the Persian histories of Amir Khusrau, Barani and Isami. Early Yadava history rests on the dynasty’s own genealogies, and the dates of the Delhi campaigns differ between sources. The map is stylised and not to scale.",
